# Xyce: level 57 is BSIMSOI, no pss, fmod and db (63f08969, part h).
# What the fix was for, as the ledger has it: `error[unsupported]` `analysis 'pss' cannot be
# written for xyce: Xyce has no periodic steady-state (shooting) analysis; its periodic analyses
# are .HB and .MPDE. Dialects that define it: ...`; output has `* [sprack] not written: analysis
# 'pss'`.
from: spectre
to: xyce
--- input
// t
simulator lang=spectre
V1 (in 0) vsource type=sine ampl=1 freq=1M
pss1 pss fund=1M harms=10 tstab=1u
--- output
t
V1 in 0 sin(0 1 1meg)
* [sprack] not written: analysis 'pss' has no xyce form
.end
--- report
warning[synthesized]: line 3: vsource: xyce needs 'sinedc' but the source gave none; wrote 0
error[unsupported]: line 4: analysis 'pss' cannot be written for xyce: Xyce has no periodic steady-state (shooting) analysis; its periodic analyses are .HB and .MPDE. Dialects that define it: hspice, spectre, vacask
